flowchart TD
    Staff[Authorized Platform Staff] --> UI[React / Vite Central CRM]
    UI --> API[Express API Gateway]
    API --> Auth[JWT Signature + HTTP-only Cookie Session]
    Auth --> Identity[(PostgreSQL platform_users / platform_sessions)]
    Auth --> Policy[Server-side Platform Authorization]
    Policy --> RBAC[(PostgreSQL role_permissions + permissions)]
    Policy --> Routes[Protected Platform Routes]
    Routes --> Tenants[Tenant Lifecycle API]
    Routes --> Security[Security / SOC Events]
    Routes --> Audit[Audit Service]
    Routes --> Impersonation[Impersonation Request Boundary]
    Routes --> System[Health / System Controls]
    Tenants --> PlatformDB[(PostgreSQL Platform Registry)]
    Security --> PlatformDB
    Audit --> PlatformDB
    Impersonation --> PlatformDB
    API -. Basic request / error telemetry .-> ConsoleLogs[Application Logs / Health Probes]
    Audit -. Structured event .-> ConsoleLogs

    classDef implemented fill:#D1FAE5,stroke:#059669,color:#064E3B
    classDef partial fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#D97706,color:#78350F
    class Staff,UI,API,Auth,Identity,Policy,RBAC,Routes,Tenants,Security,System,PlatformDB implemented
    class Audit,Impersonation,ConsoleLogs partial
